  "question": {
    "html": "<p>When an electron moves at speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> in a magnetic field of strength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> at a right angle to the field direction, the magnitude of the force experienced by the electron is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Bev\"></span>. What is the force experienced by a proton that is moving in a field of strength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{B}{2}\"></span> at speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{2}\"></span> opposite the field direction?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">zero</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Bev}{4}\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Bev\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4Bev\"></span> </li>\n</ol>"
